*> Test of 33 section 1, Server tick order (core/src/worldsim-33.cob; T0499): the pause when empty, the Set Time heartbeat, the autosave countdown, the latency broadcast, the status rebuild, which steps stand still when the game is frozen and the order of the levels.
*> A case loads its inputs from a text of numbers (LOAD-IN fills WS-I as integers and WS-FX as doubles), calls the program
*> and shows the outputs WS-R(1..WS-N) joined by "/", one group per call; expected values come from the rules and tables of the section.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-WORLDSIM-33-1.
 DATA DIVISION.
